// Aether Server: local BIND zones and forwarding.
//
// This file is included by the stock /etc/bind/named.conf. Recursion and
// cache are limited to loopback in the stock options; add "allow-query" and
// "allow-transfer" ACLs before serving a wider network.
//
// Example authoritative zone (uncomment and create the matching zone file):
//
// zone "lan" {
//     type primary;
//     file "/var/cache/bind/db.lan";
//     allow-update { none; };
// };
//
// Until a zone is defined, the resolver only forwards. Point these at your
// upstream or internal resolvers as required.
